.git
.github
**/node_modules

# NEVER bake a credential into an image.
#
# Both `tools/ambient` and `tools/support-bot` keep their minted character
# tokens in `secrets/`, and both Dockerfiles `COPY tools/<x>` wholesale from the
# repo root, so without this line the plaintext tokens travel inside every image
# built from a laptop that has provisioned. Neither service reads them from
# there anyway: Fly writes them to `/secrets/...` at boot via a `[[files]]`
# block, which is the whole reason that block exists.
**/secrets

# The support bot's ledger and audit log come from its volume, never the image.
# (`tools/ambient/state` is deliberately NOT excluded: `servers.json` is a
# matched pair with `personas.yaml` and travels in the image on purpose.)
tools/support-bot/state
**/dist
**/release
*.log
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.vscode
.idea
electron/release
client/dist
server/dist
packages/shared/dist
